#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "An introduction to the basics of quantum computing, designed to get you started as quickly as possible."
msgstr "Una introducción a los fundamentos de la computación cuántica, diseñada para ayudarte a comenzar lo más rápido posible."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visión general"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Visión general {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Use a quantum computer today*! In the course, you'll start using a quantum computer immediately, and learn the basic principles of quantum computing along the way.\n"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido/a a *Usa una computadora cuántica hoy*! En este curso, empezarás a usar una computadora cuántica de inmediato y aprenderás los principios básicos de la computación cuántica a lo largo del camino.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is designed for the curious and the busy. You don't need a physics degree or years of programming experience. If you can follow along with a notebook and click \"Run,\" you're ready.\n"
msgstr "Este curso está diseñado para las personas curiosas y ocupadas. No necesitas un título en física ni años de experiencia en programación. Si puedes seguir un notebook y hacer clic en \"Run\", estás listo/a.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Examen {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for the \"Using a quantum computer\" course, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Para obtener tu insignia del curso \"Usar una computadora cuántica\", realiza el examen en IBM&reg; Training. Este examen está pensado para tomarse después de leer las lecciones de este curso. Después de aprobar el examen, Credly te notificará que has obtenido una insignia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Examen](/learning/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Insignia Otorgada {#awarded-badge}"

